# Repo-only docs at source root. Patterns match DESTINATION names.
# Leading slash keeps these to $HOME/AGENTS.md and $HOME/README.md;
# a bare AGENTS.md pattern would also drop nested files (for example
# .codex/AGENTS.md) and any other source whose target is AGENTS.md.
# /AGENTS.md stays in git for Pi/Codex in this repo; it is not deployed.
# Pi-global instructions are dot_pi/agent/literal_AGENTS.md -> ~/.pi/agent/AGENTS.md.
# Do not add a source that deploys to ~/AGENTS.md: same target as this file,
# chezmoi reports inconsistent state.
# /README.md is the product README; do not also land it at ~/README.md.
/AGENTS.md
/README.md
docs/
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/*
.codex/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.codex/AGENTS.md
!.codex/config.toml
